# EncryptingBlend – Minimal x402 Private Payments Gateway (TypeScript)

A production‑grade starter that implements the core **x402 → gateway → verify** flow with Solana plumbing, pluggable privacy rails (Elusiv, Confidential Balances, Light Protocol), signed receipts, and a tiny client SDK. Most pieces run out‑of‑the‑box; privacy providers are stubbed with clear TODOs.

> Directory layout

```
EncryptingBlend/
  ├─ package.json
  ├─ tsconfig.json
  ├─ .env.example
  ├─ src/
  │   ├─ server.ts
  │   ├─ config.ts
  │   ├─ types.ts
  │   ├─ middleware/send402.ts
  │   ├─ crypto/
  │   │   ├─ keys.ts
  │   │   └─ receipt.ts
  │   ├─ services/
  │   │   ├─ solana.ts
  │   │   ├─ elusiv.ts
  │   │   ├─ confidential.ts
  │   │   └─ light.ts
  │   ├─ store/memory.ts
  │   └─ routes/payments.ts
  └─ sdk/
      └─ blend-client.ts
```

