## .env.example

```bash
# Solana cluster RPC
RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
# Or devnet for testing
# RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com

# Gateway keypair (base58 secret key). If blank, generated on boot and printed to console.
GATEWAY_SECRET_KEY=

# Default token mint (USDC on dev/mainnet differs). Put your target mint here.
TOKEN_MINT=Es9vMFrzaCER... # USDC example (replace!)

# Allow CORS from your merchant/client origin
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
```

